<title>PHILIPPINES: PSBANK 9-mth net up at 337.49 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>PSBANK 9-mth net up at 337.49 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30.</p>
<p>	    (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net income		   337.49 vs 212.80</p>
<p>    Interest income	    1,410  vs 982.50</p>
<p>    Net interest income	647.96 vs 504.65</p>
<p>Note: Full name Philippine Savings Bank. It is a member of the MetroBank Group.</p>
</text>
